<h4 align="center">Grand Theft Auto VI (Xbox Series) running natively on Windows + Vulkan, built on your PC from your own copy — unifying active community runtime, shader, and Rust work into one booting baseline.</h4>

<p align="center">
  <a href="docs/i18n/README.md">Other languages</a> |
  <a href="#project-status">Status</a> |
  <a href="#measured-boot-progression">Boot Milestones</a> |
