## Project status

The runtime reaches a continuous `ALIVE` (`60.9s`, `exc=none`) `PresentX` frame loop with deep asset streaming on Windows 11 + Vulkan (zero Vulkan validation errors). Visible retail frames are not on screen yet — see **[Want to Help?](#want-to-help)** below for the highest-impact open engineering work.

| Subsystem | Status in `leonida-ultimate` (Wave-15 / v10) |
|---|---|
| Retail boot & frame loop (`gta6rt`) | ⚠️ **Reaches continuous `ALIVE` (`60.9s`, `exc=none`) `PresentX` frame loop & deep asset streaming** (`78` unique D3D12 slots, `240,201` D3D12 calls, `4,761` `PresentX` frames, `19` detiled `xg_xs` textures / `14` non-zero, `8.7 GB` streaming working set, `0` Vulkan validation errors); visible retail frames pending remaining view/blend/descriptor work + translated shader testing ([docs/DEV_FRONTIERS.md](docs/DEV_FRONTIERS.md)) |
| Finding and checking your copy (Xbox Series 1.0.2.1) | ✅ Works (`make_game.py --check`) |
| Shaders (`RDNA2 → SPIR-V`) | ✅ **`26,503 / 26,503` translated & `spirv-val` valid**; accelerated with in-process Rust `spirv_asm_native` (`42×`), `rdna2_decode_native`, `spirv_opt_native` (`8–10×`), LPT size-balanced resumable sharding (`--assembler auto`, `--no-validate`), plus opt-in warm on-demand JIT shader daemon (`LEONIDA_JIT_SHADERS`) |
| Xbox D3D12 → Vulkan | ⚠️ Active: zero-alloc lock-free draw recording (`43.6 ns`/draw), zero-alloc replay, deferred draw pipeline selection, Xbox rect/quad lists (topologies 17 & 19), `BeginRenderPass`, `FramePacer` mailbox, `VK_EXT_mesh_shader`, `VK_EXT_depth_bounds`, `A8_UNORM` 1D/3D, `R9G9B9E5` UAV, 3D UAV/SRV/RTV, slot 133 implicit castable views, placed-texture buffer SRV alias, MIT typeless present ([docs/d3d12_vulkan.md](docs/d3d12_vulkan.md)) |
| Audio & Media | ✅ `xapu.dll` (256 streams, native Windows 11 `MSOpusDecoder.dll` MFT), `chad.dll` (128 DSP streams), portable XMA2/WMA-Pro decoder, `acphal.cpp`, offline Media Foundation |
| DirectStorage & BCPack | ✅ MIT clean-room CPU BCPack BC1/BC3/BC4/BC5/BC7 decompression (`bcpack_dstorage`), `ReadFile` page-commit fallback |
| Ray Tracing (`XboxBvhBuilder` / XDXR) | ⚠️ `XboxBvhBuilder.dll`, Vulkan XDXR BLAS/TLAS builder (including paired BLAS density, serialize/deserialize) & `LEONIDA_RT_AS=khr` ([docs/xdxr.md](docs/xdxr.md), [docs/bvh.md](docs/bvh.md)) |
| Native Rust accelerators (`tools/native/`) | ✅ **8 zero-dependency Rust accelerators** (`anim_clips`, `bc7`, `bvh`, `glb`, `meshlet`, `rdna2_decode`, `spirv_asm`, `spirv_opt`) building in ~4s |
| PE loader, XMem, GDK & GameInput | ✅ Placeholder-window commit fallback, `__XMemAllocationHooks__`, `xgamesave` offline provider, `XAppCaptureImpl`, offline `ws2_32.dll`, SHA-NI loader perf pack, SDL3 GameInput ([docs/gameinput.md](docs/gameinput.md)) |
| Models, Textures (DDS/BCPack), Audio (AWC) | ✅ Exported via `rpf9dump` & clean-room `tools/bcpack.py` ([docs/models.md](docs/models.md), [docs/textures.md](docs/textures.md), [docs/audio.md](docs/audio.md)) |

To generate a live offline progress report on your own checkout, run `python -I tools/progress_dashboard.py --out <folder outside the repo>` ([docs/progress_dashboard.md](docs/progress_dashboard.md)).

