## How It Works

| Piece | What it does | Where |
|---|---|---|
| Version check | Every package file's name, size, and SHA-256 for each supported version (hashes only, zero game content) | `game/`, `make_game.py` |
| Shader pipeline | Carves DXBC containers, unpacks `XBCH` → `FSSM` native RDNA2 code, disassembles (`llvm-mc` / `rdna2_decode`), translates to SPIR-V, and optimizes | `tools/shader_carve.py`, `tools/fssm_unpack.py`, `tools/shader_disasm.py`, `tools/rdna2spirv.py`, `tools/spirv_opt.py` |
| Native Rust accelerators | 8 zero-dependency Rust DLLs accelerating BC7, SPIR-V assembly (`42×`), SPIR-V optimization (`8–10×`), RDNA2 decoding, BVH, GLB, meshlets, and animation clips | `tools/native/` |
| Asset export | Extracts validated models, textures (DDS/BCPack), and audio (AWC) from RPF9 archives and `.ttpf` pools | `tools/rpf9dump`, `tools/bcpack.py`, `tools/ttpf_assets.py` |
| Windows/Vulkan runtime | Maps the PE image and resolves console imports to native shims (GDK, XMem, DirectStorage/BCPack, `d3d12_xs` → Vulkan, `XboxBvhBuilder`, `xapu`/`chad`/`acphal` audio) | `runtime/` |
| Map viewer | Local-only browser viewer for exported world geometry, textures, and streaming chunks | `viewer/` |
| Documentation & specs | Measured ABI contracts, shader translator rules, Vulkan architecture, audio/BVH/asset notes, and developer frontiers | `docs/` ([index](docs/README.md)) |

